- I. Csiszár (1967). *Information-type measures of difference of probability distributions and indirect observations*. Studia Scientiarum Mathematicarum Hungarica 2, 299--318.
- T. Minka (2005). *Divergence measures and message passing*. Microsoft Research Technical Report MSR-TR-2005-173.
- X. Nguyen, M. J. Wainwright, M. I. Jordan (2010). *Estimating divergence functionals and the likelihood ratio by convex risk minimization*. IEEE Transactions on Information Theory 56(11). [arXiv:0809.0853](https://arxiv.org/abs/0809.0853)
